OL,3,GNEWSAPeople flee as fireworks thrown in
OL,4,Acity centre street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter fireworks were thrown in a street
OL,8,Fon Bonfire Night.
OL,10,FShocking footage shared on social media
OL,11,Fshowed people running for cover as
OL,12,Ffireworks were aimed at buildings,
OL,13,Fmembers of the public and police
OL,14,Fofficers, on Staniforth Street, near
OL,15,FAston University.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
