OL,3,GNEWSAPeople flee as fireworks thrown in
OL,4,Acity centre street
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes less than a week after similar
OL,7,Fscenes unfolded during Halloween
OL,8,Fcelebrations in Birmingham city centre.
OL,9,FSeven people, aged between 15 and 26,
OL,10,Fwere arrested after fireworks were set
OL,11,Foff close to police officers and
OL,12,Fvehicles on Corporation Street.
OL,14,FBirmingham Police Commander Chief
OL,15,FSuperintendent Tom Joyce described the
OL,16,Flatest incidents as "irresponsible and
OL,17,Fdangerous".
